  "description": "YUSTAI crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H115 O25 Yb5,2(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1C (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.484-4.927 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.60-156.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C164H131Yb5O25.",
